# The Talos release yyc-talos runs (README "Node work"). `yyc-talos gen` renders new nodes with it; the workflow
# talos-nodes.yml upgrades every node to it (one at a time) and, on its weekly run, commits the newest patch release
# of this minor here first. `KEY=VALUE` lines: sourced by node-work.sh, read by yyc-talos.
TALOS_VERSION=v1.14.6
# Image Factory installer for the vanilla schematic (no extensions), the same for arm64 and amd64. It must be Hetzner's
# own (hcloud-installer), never the generic `installer`: the arm64 nodes boot a UKI, whose kernel command line comes
# with the installer, and the generic one boots as platform metal (no talos.platform=hcloud, no net.ifnames=0), so the
# node comes up with no hostname and no address (README "Node work", pitfall). node-work.sh refuses any other.
TALOS_INSTALLER=factory.talos.dev/hcloud-installer/376567988ad370138ad8b2698212367b8edcb69b5fd68c80be1f2ec7d603b4ba
